@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="booking-hero reveal">
    <svg class="star-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 1 L15 8 L22 9 L17 14 L18.5 21 L12 17.5 L5.5 21 L7 14 L2 9 L9 8 Z" />
    </svg>
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: 23 July 2026</p>
</div>

<svg class="arch-divider" viewBox="0 0 1200 64" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,64 C 300,0 900,0 1200,64" />
</svg>

<div class="booking-card reveal corner-frame" style="max-width: 820px; text-align: left;">

    <p>
        Bait Al Libas L.L.C. This policy explains
        what information we collect when you use this website or book an appointment with us,
        how we use it, and the choices you have.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
        When you submit a booking request through our "Book a Tailor" form, or contact us
        directly, we may collect:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your full name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>WhatsApp number</li>
        <li>Delivery or fitting address, including your Dubai area</li>
        <li>Preferred appointment date and time</li>
        <li>Any notes you choose to add to your booking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        If you create an account, we also store your login credentials securely; we never
        store passwords in plain text.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Confirm and manage your tailor appointment or order</li>
        <li>Contact you by email or WhatsApp about your booking</li>
        <li>Provide customer support</li>
        <li>Improve our services and the experience of using this site</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We do not use your information for automated advertising profiling, and we do not
        sell your personal information to anyone.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Email &amp; WhatsApp Privacy</h2>
    <p>
        We never share or sell your email address or WhatsApp number to third parties. We use
        them only to reach you about a booking you've made, or, if you've told us it's alright,
        to let you know about new collections or offers. You can ask us to stop these messages
        at any time by contacting us directly.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Sharing of Information</h2>
    <p>
        We do not sell or rent your personal data. We only share information where it's
        necessary to run our business, such as with:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Our in-house tailors and fitting staff, to fulfil your appointment</li>
        <li>Delivery or courier partners, if a physical order needs to reach you</li>
        <li>Payment processors, only if and when online payment is introduced on this site</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Any such sharing takes place over secure, encrypted connections, and only to the
        extent needed to complete the relevant task.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Data Security</h2>
    <p>
        We use industry-standard security practices to protect the information you share with
        us, including encrypted connections (SSL/TLS) between your browser and our servers.
        No online system is ever completely risk-free, but we work to keep your data safe and
        limit access to it internally to staff who need it to do their jobs.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
        You may ask us at any time to tell you what information we hold about you, to correct
        it, or to delete it, subject to any bookings or records we're legally required to keep.
        Reach out using the contact details below to make a request.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices
        or for legal reasons. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised effective
        date, so please check back periodically.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 32px;">Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
        If you have any questions about this policy or how we handle your information, contact
        us at
        <a class="footer-link" href="mailto:info@baital-libas.com" style="display:inline;">info@baital-libas.com</a>
        or WhatsApp
        <a class="footer-link" href="https://wa.me/971542448181" style="display:inline;">+971 54 244 8181</a>.
    </p>

</div>
